I search for a clinic on my mobile.
I find the phone number of a nearby clinic.
I make a call to that number.
A woman answers the call.
"Namaste, I am speaking from the clinic," she says politely.
"Namaste, my name is Maya," I say.
"Today I am not well."
"I have severe pain in my head."
"I want to see the doctor today."
She asks, "When do you want to come?"
I look at the clock.
It is nine o'clock now.
"Can I come at ten o'clock?" I ask.
"Yes, you can come at ten o'clock," she says.
"You should rest now."
"The doctor will be here at ten o'clock."
I say thank you to her.
I end the call.
I place the mobile on the bed.
